      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-11-04_WidnesExaminer_art0102" n="art0102">
        <p>_</p>
        <p>12 Year ,oifip Permanently Cured,</p>
        <p>L'OR over 12 years," said Mr. J. I: Webster, of 9, Strawberry Road, Armley, Leeds, who works in a local munition factory, "I suffered from highly inflamed piles. The pain wore me down, and my health was very poor. I had to buy a chair with a specially made basket seat, for I could not bear to sit in an ordinary chair. I have literally cried with the scalding, itching pain. "Various remedies gave me no relief. I spent pounds on useless ointments.</p>
        <p>"One night when I was simply frantic with pain I picked up a local paper, and the heading, Zam-Buk for itching piles,' caught my eye, so I at once sent for a box. I felt easier after the first application of Zam-Buk. Zam-Buk soothed away the irritation, took away the inflammation and in a surprisingly short time the piles had entirely disaPpeared. Thanks to Zam-Buk, I feel like a new man."</p>
        <p>Zam-Buk is prepared with great skill solely from reliable vegetable substances which have all a specific medicinal action. Zam-Buk is unlike anything else in character and for good results. Its fame for aches, wounds, and num- erous skin affections is established throughout the world. Sold by all Chemists, Drug Stores, and Patent Medicine Dealers.</p>
