        <p>made from a rtrescription of a famous physician. On the slightest indication of your liver being out of order, biliousness, and all stomach and kidney troubles, take a dose or two of these wonderful Pills. The effect is marvellous. They quickly make you fit for your daily duties. 1/3 and 2/6 boxes post free; or a sample for id. stamp jot postage. Write: •</p>
