      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-11-04_WidnesExaminer_art0170" n="art0170">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 4, 1916.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 4, 1916.</p>
        <p>Shops, Businesses. &amp;e.</p>
