        <p>Perhaps He Was Right. "You're a swindler," exclaimed Mrs. Talks, entering the bird shop. "You ought to be ashamed of yourself 'cheating a poor, inn,cent woman the way you did. That parrot l bought of you last week is a fraud. You said it was a fluent talker, and you charged a big price for it, and here he hasn't said a single word since I got him: Not one word. Do you hear me? Not —one—single—word!" "Perhaps," suggested the bird fancier, "you didn't give him a chance, madam."</p>
